1
00:00:01,910 --> 00:00:06,710
Right-click a tab, such as Summary, and undock it.

2
00:00:06,810 --> 00:00:09,570
Summary now has a window of its own.

3
00:00:09,670 --> 00:00:15,460
Undock a second panel, here Instruments.

4
00:00:15,560 --> 00:00:17,800
With two panels floating, a + appears in the title bar.

5
00:00:17,900 --> 00:00:21,210
Pick a panel to bring it into this window as a tab.

6
00:00:21,310 --> 00:00:25,900
Click the tabs to switch between the panels.

7
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:30,460
The arrow on a tab moves it out into a window of its own again.

8
00:00:30,560 --> 00:00:33,020
Yellow minimises a window to the taskbar.

9
00:00:33,120 --> 00:00:35,580
Green makes it full size, and restores it again.

10
00:00:35,680 --> 00:00:41,310
Red puts the panel back in the main window.

11
00:00:41,410 --> 00:00:44,310
Both panels are back in their tabs.

